    "enUS": {
      "description": "Hmm... I don't see anything out of the ordinary with this shield. We should have Do'gol, the blacksmith, take a look at it, and see if he can tell us more about it, but I wouldn't hold out hope...",
      "dialogue": {
        "1a55727506be2b5e1d06": "This is good shield. Very strong, heavy, good. But Do'gol don't need it. I make shields, not buy them, $n.$b$bYou should know that.",
        "c4c653422f26cd99046f": "Something for me, $c?",
        "f4ca4d112ff04b9b078a": "Hmm... I don't see anything out of the ordinary with this shield. We should have Do'gol, the blacksmith, take a look at it, and see if he can tell us more about it, but I wouldn't hold out hope..."
      },
